<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PMT Services raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PMT Services raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded PMT Services Inc to buy from outperform, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
<p>-- PMT closed at 11-3/4 Monday.</p>
